# FILE:      .gitattributes
# CREATED:   2026-10-20 13:27 +03
# TASK:      596
# AUTHOR:    kwtSMS
# WHAT:      Line-ending and binary rules for the repository.
# WHY:       The working tree lives on an NTFS drive under WSL. Forcing LF keeps PHP, Smarty
#            templates and .po files byte-identical to what CS-Cart servers (Linux) expect.
# USAGE:     Read by git automatically.
# DEPENDS:   Nothing.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
